Package: PixFluRoBlend
Title: Blend Pixel and RFU Quantification Using Monotone Dose-Response Fits
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Zachary", "Madaj", email = "zachary.madaj@vai.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits monotone-increasing smooth curves (via scam) to signals
    quantified by two methods (pixel intensity and RFU), then combines them
    into a single estimate with a weighted geometric mean. Weights depend on
    where the two curves cross and on each method's estimated precision.
